WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.565 --> 00:00:06.219
Ring up a sale in seconds.

2
00:00:24.867 --> 00:00:29.705
Cash, card, transfer or invoice
— with or without a customer.

3
00:00:31.828 --> 00:00:34.669
Inventory Health finds the problems first.

4
00:00:41.740 --> 00:00:45.019
Ask about your own shop,
in your own words.

5
00:00:52.188 --> 00:00:55.612
It reads your live data. Never a guess.

6
00:00:55.972 --> 00:01:00.567
It proposes. You approve. Then it happens.
